ht,b,a} 18, {right,b} 12 = 30 frames. 16 cycles = 480 frames. Plus maybe final.\n\nLet me build: 16 iterations. I'll write it out.\n\nActually play_input max 600 frames per call. 16*30 = 480. Good.\n\nWatch $0086 and $006D to track position. watch [134,109] (0x0086, 0x006D). Also $079F (1951) to see star timer.\n\nLet me run."}
